   "source": "Roll Bama Roll",
   "summary": "How about that 18 point Alabama victory over LSU in Baton Rouge? I hope if you bet that you made a nice little killing on that game. It was absurd to think Bama was almost a touchdown underdog in Bryant-Denny-Bayou Stadium. The last time Alabama lost a game in the Tigers\u2019 stadium by that spread [&#8230;]",
