   "title": "11 \u201cRed Zone only\u201d graphs from the LSU win",
   "link": "https://www.rollbamaroll.com/alabama-crimson-tide-stats/86217/11-red-zone-only-graphs-from-the-lsu-win",
   "source": "Roll Bama Roll",
   "summary": "Rolllllllllllll TIDE! What a strange and exhilarating game. It was looking like Alabama was clinging on for dear life for 80% of this game, but then the Tetris pieces just started landing right, all at once. Here are some alternative titles I considered for this post: *Consider the last time you played Rock-Paper-Scissors and lost [&#8230;]",
